Alembic migration environment for Endemica.

Use the justfile rather than invoking alembic directly:

    just db-migrate                  # upgrade to head
    just db-revision "add x table"   # autogenerate from model changes
    just db-downgrade                # roll back one revision
    just db-reset                    # destructive: base then head

The database URL is read from Endemica's settings in env.py, so alembic.ini
contains no credentials.
